<body>

    <!-- Navigation Bar -->
    <div class="headerWrapper">
        <div class="navbar">
            <ul>
                <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="risks.html">Health Risks</a></li>
                <li><a href="effects.html">Effects</a></li>
                <li><a href="dependence.html">Dependence & Withdrawal</a></li>
                <li><a href="resources.html">Resources</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <header>
        <h1>The Health Risks of Kratom</h1>
    </header>

    <!-- FIXED IMAGE: your filename had a space, which breaks GitHub Pages -->
    <img src="images/kratom-label.png" alt="Kratom warning label from a public health source">

    <p class="caption">
        Public health warnings highlight the risks associated with kratom use.
    </p>

    <p class="caption">
        Image credit: FDA / DVIDS (Public Domain)
    </p>

    <main>
        <section>
            <h2>Major Health Risks</h2>

            <p>
                Kratom can affect the body in different ways depending on the amount used 
                and the person using it. Although kratom comes from a plant, natural does 
                not always mean something is safe.
            </p>

            <img 
                src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Kratom_plant.jpg"
                alt="Kratom plant leaves used to make kratom products"
            >
            <p class="caption">
                Kratom plant. Image: Wikimedia Commons, CC0.
            </p>

            <p>
                Some reported risks include liver toxicity, seizures, dependence, withdrawal, 
                and contamination in unregulated products. People should be cautious and seek 
                reliable information before using kratom.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>

</body>
